$ moolah init --base ILS --no-backup-key
Created book "main" in $TMP/data/books/main.db (base currency ILS).
Next: add your accounts, for example:
  moolah account add assets:bank:mybank --currency ILS --opening 1000
  moolah category list

$ moolah account add assets:bank:leumi --currency ILS --opening 1000 --date 2026-10-01
Added assets:bank:leumi (ILS).

$ moolah category add food:restuarants
Added category food:restuarants.

$ moolah category add nosuch:child
error: expenses:nosuch does not exist. Create the parent first
[exit 1]

$ moolah add leumi -50 restuarants --date 2026-10-02
Added transaction 2 on 2026-10-02:
  assets:bank:leumi              -50.00 ILS
  expenses:food:restuarants      50.00 ILS

$ moolah category rename food:restuarants food:eating-out
Renamed food:restuarants to food:eating-out.

$ moolah register --category eating-out
ID  Date        Payee  Other side            Amount    Balance
 2  2026-10-02         assets:bank:leumi  50.00 ILS  50.00 ILS

$ moolah category merge eating-out food:restaurants
Merged eating-out into food:restaurants (1 transaction line moved).

$ moolah register --category food:restaurants
ID  Date        Payee  Other side            Amount    Balance
 2  2026-10-02         assets:bank:leumi  50.00 ILS  50.00 ILS

$ moolah account close leumi --date 2026-10-31
error: assets:bank:leumi has a balance of 950.00 ILS on 2026-10-31; move it to another account first
[exit 1]

$ moolah add pension 100 food
error: income:salary:pension is a category; this needs a real account (assets or liabilities)
[exit 1]

$ moolah category add salary:bonus --income
Added category income:salary:bonus.

$ moolah account list
Name         Currency  Closed
assets
  bank
    leumi    ILS
  cash
  invest
liabilities
  card
  loan

